# NOTE: public/version.json is NOT gitignored.
# The GH Actions workflow's "Commit version.json with APK info" step
# needs to `git add public/version.json` to publish APK release URLs.
# Gitignoring it broke that step (run 31290129685 failed 2026-08-09).
# The prebuild script (scripts/generate-version-manifest.cjs) regenerates
# it on every Vercel build with the correct GITHUB_SHA, so the committed
# version is always slightly stale but the DEPLOYED version is always correct.
